{
  "id": "asset-540a7239-e756-4f8b",
  "name": "深棕楼梯",
  "prompt": "一座室内直跑式木质loft楼梯，连接地面与约4.42米高的夹层。踏步厚实规整，左右两侧均设连续扶手、密集竖向栏杆和加粗端柱。栏杆比普通楼梯栏杆稍高，垂直于踏步测量约1.25米高。整体结构坚固精致，适合炼金工坊，木纹清晰。楼梯与配套夹层栏杆的构件尺寸、立柱、竖杆和扶手造型完全一致。所有普通材质仅使用目标色卡颜色：主木色#52362E，较亮木纹和边缘#714D48，不使用任何色卡外颜色。\nCoordinate contract: local Y+ is up, local Z+ is the front, entrance, or forward direction, and local X+ is right. Put doors, facades, openings, windshields, noses, seats, and other recognizable front details toward local Z+. For a modular repeated element, explicitly choose the long axis: side-by-side modules span local X with depth/front on local Z; traversal modules span local Z. Keep the model centered at its origin.\nCanonical dimensions contract: width=2.35, height=5.65, depth=7.4 world units. Keep the generated mesh within this centered bounding size.",
